  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accelerating key net zero Technologies by leveraging Industrial Decarbonization&#xa0;investment (ACTION)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ACTION project objective is to support climate action in Brazil through accelerating market development for Carbon-Negative Orga no-Mineral Fertilizers utilized sustainable organic waste streams.  The ACTION project aims at developing and implementing a sustainable, local value chain for low-carbon fertilizer production by addressing the key barriers. The ACTION project would harness local resources to create eco-friendly fertilizers, aiming to significantly reduce the carbon footprint of the agricultural sector and unlock the biogas industry#s whole potential. By doing so, the project would also strive to empower local communities, enhance agricultural productivity, and profitability, and contribute to a greener, more sustainable future.</narrative>
  </description>
